{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Tujhe lage na najariya,
[C],        kyun na odhe tu chunariya
[C],        Tuze lage na najriya odh le chunriya
[A#] [Gm],        Thirchhi nigahe mere dil pe giraye
[C],        re bijuria, bijuria
[C],        Haye tera sharmana, tauba tera itraana
[A#] [F] [C],        Jo bhi dekhe ho jaye woh diwana tera
[C],        Sone jaisa tan tera, uff bhola pan tera
[A#] [F] [C],        Mujko bhi kar gaya deewana tera
[C],        O sun baki re gujariya,
[C],        yahi bole hai dagaria
[C],        Sun baki re gujariya, bole ye dagaria
[A#] [Gm],        Lachke kamariya to chhalke gagariya
[C],        ki luti re bajaria
[C],        Naina matwale ye bal gugrale ye
[A#] [F] [C],        bhole bhale dil pe chalaye chhuriya.
[C],        Mehki hawayen bhi yahi gunguye ki
[A#] [F] [C],        dil se dil milale aa mitaye duriyan.
[C],        O sun baki re gujariya,
[C],        ho main hun tera hi sawariyan.
[C],        O sun baki re gujariya,tera ye sawariyan
[A#] [Gm],        Tuj pe hi marta hai Naam tere karta hai
[C],        sari umariya
[C],        Khwabon ki tu rani hai,
[C],        geeton ki jawani hai
[A#] [F] [C],        Tere bina ab kahin lage na jiya
[C],        Itni si kahani hai, tu hi zindagani hai
[A#] [F] [C],        goriya ye tune kaisa jadoo hai kiya
[C],        O sun baki re gujariya,
[C],        haan meri bholi si bawariyan
[C],        O sun baki re gujriya bholi si bawriya
[A#] [Gm],        Teri angdaayi mere Dil ko hai bhayi
[C],        chhayi banke badariya
